hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17619","Hasan narrated to us: Ibn Lahi'ah narrated to us, from 'Uqayl ibn Khalid, from Ibn Shihab, from 'Urwah, from Usamah ibn Zayd, from his father Zayd ibn Harithah, from the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), that Jibril, peace be upon him, came to him at the beginning of what was revealed to him and taught him ablution and prayer. When he finished ablution, he took a handful of water and sprinkled his private part with it."
